Z||000000||skitime||08-24-2001||01:38 PM||||Perhaps you already noticed but I thought this feature was neat.  We now can look the forum member lists through the Inbox. If you click on Inbox at the bottom of the main page, then on Member List you can look at the entire members list. You can click on sort and have the list sorted by Name, Date, and Location.  So now you can find all the members in your state or city and find who was the first or last member. <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
